{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>For, etc.</b> This verse proves that it is for the future. Some say that this prophecy was fulfilled in the days of Nebuchadnezzar after the exile of Zion, as in 'the cup shall also pass over to you' (Lamentations 4:21)." "<b>The year of recompences.</b> Like 'your recompense shall return upon your head' (Obadiah 1:15). Scripture too in the book of Obadiah concerns Edom."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:38.511944160Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}